* Physical AI - Experiment 16 architecture I: current-mode invert-and-sum, unbuffered compensated dividers
* Passive inverting amplifiers (R ratio) create -Vin. One 0 V summing node per neuron. One current dump onto physical R_IV. Fine taps load-compensated, no isolation buffer. No dual CCCS.
* Frozen Experiment 9 network A. Weights were not edited.
* Behavioral circuit analysis. Not transistor-level or PCB power.
* invert A=100000 R_INV=10000 Ileak=0 rail=15 linear=False vos=0
* shape: 2 -> 4 -> 1

Vin1 in1 0 DC 0
* passive invert in1 -> in1n: R2/R1=1.0000200002 closed-loop -1 at A=100000
Rinv1ia in1 inv1m 10000
Rinv1ib in1n inv1m 10000.200002
Einv1amp in1n 0 0 inv1m 100000
Vin2 in2 0 DC 0
Vref vref 0 DC 1
* passive invert vref -> vrefn: R2/R1=1.0000200002 closed-loop -1 at A=100000
Rinvrefia vref invrefm 10000
Rinvrefib vrefn invrefm 10000.200002
Einvrefamp vrefn 0 0 invrefm 100000
* load-compensated divider vref->tapref: G_load=0.000833646933955897 Ra=544815.897488381 Rb=1000 target beta=0.001 (no tap buffer)
Rdivrefa vref tapref 544815.897488381
Rdivrefb tapref 0 1000
* load-compensated divider vrefn->taprefn: G_load=0.00135041774642313 Ra=425030.827613635 Rb=1000 target beta=0.001 (no tap buffer)
Rdivrefna vrefn taprefn 425030.827613635
Rdivrefnb taprefn 0 1000

* h1 input 1 w=+0.683760795348816 w+  bank=n alpha=1 R=48749.9920441162 G_phys=2.05128238604645e-05 G_eff=2.05128238604645e-05
Rh1p1n1 in1 h1p 48749.9920441162
* h1 input 2 w=+0.309366783045794 w+  bank=n alpha=1 R=107746.969487669 G_phys=9.28100349137382e-06 G_eff=9.28100349137382e-06
Rh1p2n1 in2 h1p 107746.969487669
* h1 bias w-  bank=f alpha=0.001 R=1253.18954325804 G_phys=0.000797963887729386 G_eff=7.97963887729385e-07
Rh1bnf1 taprefn h1p 1253.18954325804
* single-copy I-to-V: 0 V sum h1p, I dump onto R_IV=33333.3333333333
Vh1p h1p 0 DC 0
Bh1iv 0 h1lin I = i(Vh1p)
Rh1iv h1lin 0 33333.3333333333
* direct bounded ReLU, no output buffer: y=max(0, min(15, v(h1lin)))
Bh1relu h1y 0 V = max(0, min(15, v(h1lin)))

* h2 input 1 w=-0.884821731731664 w-  bank=n alpha=1 R=37672.3718890781 G_phys=2.65446519519499e-05 G_eff=2.65446519519499e-05
